<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Favorite Planet</title>
    <style>
        em{
            font-style: italic;
            color: purple;
        }
        a:link {
            color: green;
            background-color: yellow;
        }
        a:visited {
            color: green;
        }
        a:hover {
            color: pink;
        }
        a:active {
            color: blue;
        }   
        body{
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        h1{
            color: #444;
            background-color: lightblue;
        }
        h2{
            color: #333;
            background-color: antiquewhite;
        }
        h3{
            color: #333;
            background-color: lightyellow;
        }
        s{
            color: red;
        }
        div.content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(200px, auto));
            gap: 20px;
            background-color: #e0f7fa;
            resize: both;
            min-height: 800px;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        div.planet-info, div.exploration-info, div.contact-info, div.exam-info {
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            min-height: 200px;
        }
        div.planet-info {
            grid-column: 1;
            grid-row: 1;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        div.exploration-info {
            grid-column: 2;
            grid-row: 1;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        div.contact-info {
            grid-column: 1;
            grid-row: 2;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        div.exam-info {
            grid-column: 2;
            grid-row: 2;
            background-color: #f1e7d2;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>My Favorite Planet</h1>
    <div class="content">
        <div class="planet-info">
            <h2>Mars</h2>
            <p>Mars is the <b>fourth planet</b> from the Sun.</p>
            <p>I think Mars is <i>one of the most interesting planets</i>in our solar system.</p>
            <hr>
            <h3>Some Facts</h3>
            <p>
                Mars has 2 moons:<br>
                Phobos<br>
                Deimos
            </p>
            <p>The average distance from Mars to the Sun is about 2.28 &times; 10<sup>8</sup> km.</p>
            <p>Water is H<sub>2</sub>O.</p>
            <hr>
            <h3>Why I Like Mars</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Mars is cold and dry</li>
                <li>but scientists are still exploring it.</li>
            </ol>
            <p><b>Maybe humans will visit Mars one day!</b></p>
            <hr>
        </div>

        <div class="exploration-info">
            <h2>Keep Exploring</h2>
            <p><strong>Remember:</strong> science begins with curiosity.</p>
            <p>I <em>really</em> want to see humans explore Mars in the future.</p>
            <p><acronym title="National Aeronautics and Space Administration">NASA</acronym> has sent many missions to Mars.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-info">
            <h2>Contact Me</h2>
            <address>
                <p><a href="mailto:no-reply@hasaki.idv.tw">no-reply@hasaki.idv.tw</a></p>
                <p><a href="tel:+1234567890">+1 (234) 567-890</a></p>
                <p>123 Main Street<br>Anytown, USA <s>12345</s>&nbsp;<a style="color: aquamarine;">12346</a></p>
            </address>
        </div>

        <div class="exam-info">
            <h2>Some exam</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>If you ask why there is a exam?</li>
                <li>I have no idea.</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://project.hasaki.idv.tw/problem/18" target="_blank"><img src="https://project.hasaki.idv.tw/static/uploads/img_3f039744dca841cb9604fc099f78dd1c.png" alt="Exam 18" width="100%"></a><br>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>